	<section id="attorneyserviceblock">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="apostille-container">
				<div class="apostille-box row">
					<div class="apostille-icon col-md-1 col-sm-12">
						<img src="images/removebg-preview.png" alt="Quick Apostille Logo"
							width="40" height="40">
					</div>
					<div class="apostille-content col-md-11 col-sm-12">
						<p class="apostille-title">
							Recognition and acceptance of the Hague (La Haya) Apostille are
							guaranteed by <img alt="" src="images/quickapostill.svg"
								style="width: 178px">
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="row">
				<h2 class="my-5 text-center">ATTORNEY SERVICES</h2>
				<span class="dashedlines"></span>
			</div>

			<div class="row block-columns mt-5">
				<div class="block-column col-md-6">
					<h3 class="mb-4">Personal documents</h3>

					<!-- Personal Document Items -->
					<div class="document-item">
						 <span class="d-flex gap-2">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"
									width="22" height="22">
									<path
										d="M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM371.8 211.8C382.7 200.9 382.7 183.1 371.8 172.2C360.9 161.3 343.1 161.3 332.2 172.2L224 280.4L179.8 236.2C168.9 225.3 151.1 225.3 140.2 236.2C129.3 247.1 129.3 264.9 140.2 275.8L204.2 339.8C215.1 350.7 232.9 350.7 243.8 339.8L371.8 211.8z" />
								</svg>

								<h5>Apostille</h5>
						</span>
							<p>Official government authentication of documents for
								international use under the Hague Convention guidelines.</p> 
					</div>

					<div class="document-item">
						 <span class="d-flex gap-2">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"
									width="22" height="22">
									<path
										d="M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM371.8 211.8C382.7 200.9 382.7 183.1 371.8 172.2C360.9 161.3 343.1 161.3 332.2 172.2L224 280.4L179.8 236.2C168.9 225.3 151.1 225.3 140.2 236.2C129.3 247.1 129.3 264.9 140.2 275.8L204.2 339.8C215.1 350.7 232.9 350.7 243.8 339.8L371.8 211.8z" />
								</svg>
								<h5>Birth Certificate Apostille</h5>
						</span>
							<p>Legalizes a birth certificate for international use,
								verifying authenticity for immigration, marriage, or education.</p>
						 
					</div>

					<div class="document-item">
						 <span class="d-flex gap-2">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"
									width="22" height="22">
									<path
										d="M0 256C0 114.6 114.6 0 256 0C397.4 0 512 114.6 512 256C512 397.4 397.4 512 256 512C114.6 512 0 397.4 0 256zM371.8 211.8C382.7 200.9 382.7 183.1 371.8 172.2C360.9 161.3 343.1 161.3 332.2 172.2L224 280.4L179.8 236.2C168.9 225.3 151.1 225.3 140.2 236.2C129.3 247.1 129.3 264.9 140.2 275.8L204.2 339.8C215.1 350.7 232.9 350.7 243.8 339.8L371.8 211.8z" />
								</svg>
								<h5>Death Certificate Apostille</h5>
						</span>
							<p>Certifies the death certificate for foreign legal use,
								often needed for inheritance or repatriation.</p> 
					</div>

					<div class="document-item">
						 <span class="d-flex gap-2">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512"
