					<div class="faq-question p-3 active" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
						data-bs-target="#faq1">
						What is an Apostille, and why do I need one? <i
							class="fa fa-angle-up" aria-hidden="true"></i>
					</div>
					<div id="faq1" class="collapse mt-2 show">
						<div class="p-3 ">An Apostille is an official certification
							that verifies the authenticity of a document for use in countries
							that are part of the Hague Convention. It is required for legal,
							educational, business, or personal documents when used
							internationally.</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="mb-3">
					<div class="faq-question p-3" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
						data-bs-target="#faq2">
						How long does it take to get an Apostille? <i
							class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
					</div>
					<div id="faq2" class="collapse mt-2">
						<div class="p-3 ">Our expedited Apostille service ensures quick processing. Depending on the document type and state, standard processing takes 1-2 business days, while rush services are available for even faster completion.</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="mb-3">
					<div class="faq-question p-3" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
						data-bs-target="#faq3">
						Which documents can you Apostille? <i class="fa fa-angle-down"
							aria-hidden="true"></i>
					</div>
					<div id="faq3" class="collapse mt-2">
						<div class="p-3 ">We handle Apostille services for birth
							certificates, marriage certificates, diplomas, transcripts, power
							of attorney, affidavits, notarized documents, business contracts,
							and more. Contact us to verify your document type.</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="mb-3">
					<div class="faq-question p-3" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
						data-bs-target="#faq4">
						Do you offer same-day Apostille services?<i
							class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
					</div>
					<div id="faq4" class="collapse mt-2">
						<div class="p-3 ">Yes, we provide expedited Apostille
							services, including same-day processing in select locations.
							Contact us to check availability and requirements for urgent
							requests.</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="mb-3">
					<div class="faq-question p-3" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
						data-bs-target="#faq5">
						How much does your Apostille service cost? <i
							class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
					</div>
					<div id="faq5" class="collapse mt-2">
						<div class="p-3 ">Our pricing varies based on the document
							type, state, and processing speed. Contact us for a detailed
							quote and to choose the best option that meets your needs.</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="mb-3">
					<div class="faq-question p-3" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
						data-bs-target="#faq6">
						How do I track the status of my Apostille request?<i
							class="fa fa-angle-down" aria-hidden="true"></i>
					</div>
					<div id="faq6" class="collapse mt-2">
						<div class="p-3 ">We keep you informed throughout the
							process. You will receive updates via email or phone, and you can
							also contact our support team for real-time tracking of your
							Apostille request.</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Add more FAQ items similarly -->

			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
